// 56×56 stage → three BoxGeometry(0.42,0.82,0.55) pale blue blocks plus isolated repeated-output cuboid
// 28×28 stage → BoxGeometry(0.48,0.48,0.45) pale blue block plus longer flattened cuboid
// 14×14 stage → long low BoxGeometry(1.55,0.20,0.22) pale blue cuboid plus repeated output cuboid
