// image dimension guide → oblique Line with two ConeGeometry arrowheads, label 224 × 224 × 3
// initial convolution output → orange-brown tall BoxGeometry slab, label Conv 7×7 Stride 2 / 112 × 112 × 64
// max-pool output → larger dark-brown BoxGeometry slab with label MaxPool
// 56×56 residual stage → three tall blue BoxGeometry tensors plus one repeated-output tensor
// 28×28 residual stage → medium blue BoxGeometry tensor plus longer flattened repeated-output tensor
// 14×14 residual stage → low long blue BoxGeometry tensor plus longer output tensor
// 7×7 residual stage → three very long thin blue BoxGeometry tensors
// stage repeat brackets → black polyline brackets with ConeGeometry arrowheads
// ellipsis/repeat markers → small blue SphereGeometry dots
// classifier output → two segmented teal BoxGeometry bars with black zigzag breaks and vertical ellipsis dots
// top ResBlock inset panel → large rounded ShapeGeometry light-gray panel with black outline spanning upper scene
// inset tensor cube → small blue BoxGeometry with dark edges
// inset operation boxes → rounded ShapeGeometry boxes colored BN orange, ReLU teal, Conv gray
